{"type":"message","id":"a726efc1","parentId":"b5a84b8a","timestamp":"2026-04-25T02:35:10.369Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-25 10:35:08 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_664eb5978d7a2e16127187d1c18827d3 [msg:om_x100b51f6cb77c8a0b2acbc560248fbc]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51f6cb77c8a0b2acbc560248fbc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_664eb5978d7a2e16127187d1c18827d3\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_664eb5978d7a2e16127187d1c18827d3\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-25 10:35 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_664eb5978d7a2e16127187d1c18827d3\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_664eb5978d7a2e16127187d1c18827d3\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_664eb5978d7a2e16127187d1c18827d3\"\n}\n```\n\n深入分析api3"}],"timestamp":1777084510366}}
