{"type":"message","id":"11901749","parentId":"62a9aea8","timestamp":"2026-04-25T02:39:21.040Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Verifying installation integrity**\n\nI need to verify the integrity of my installation and check if there's an outdated skill notice. It's possible that I need to install or update something since it might have been more than 12 hours since my last cache. I should follow the steps 1-4 every time. I'll check the last_check, and then proceed to install or update with a checksum to ensure everything is correct. Let’s get started!\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PwcOJg5hYQ1FtDoXpLR0Vdgo","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"set -e\nLATEST_TAG=v2.5.0\nmkdir -p /tmp/onchainos_verify\ncurl -sSL \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/okx/onchainos-skills/${LATEST_TAG}/install.sh\" -o /tmp/onchainos_verify/install.sh\ncurl -sSL \"https://github.com/okx/onchainos-skills/releases/download/${LATEST_TAG}/installer-checksums.txt\" -o /tmp/onchainos_verify/installer-checksums.txt\nEXPECTED=$(grep ' install.sh$' /tmp/onchainos_verify/installer-checksums.txt | awk '{print $1}')\nACTUAL=$(sha256sum /tmp/onchainos_verify/install.sh | awk '{print $1}')\necho \"EXPECTED=$EXPECTED\"\necho \"ACTUAL=$ACTUAL\"\nif [ \"$EXPECTED\" != \"$ACTUAL\" ]; then\n  echo 'INSTALLER_CHECKSUM_MISMATCH'\n  exit 2\nfi\nLAST_CHECK=\"$HOME/.onchainos/last_check\"\nNEED_INSTALL=0\nif [ ! -f \"$LAST_CHECK\" ]; then\n  NEED_INSTALL=1\nelse\n  NOW=$(date +%s)\n  MTIME=$(stat -c %Y \"$LAST_CHECK\" 2>/dev/null || echo 0)\n  AGE=$((NOW-MTIME))\n  if [ \"$AGE\" -gt 43200 ]; then\n    NEED_INSTALL=1\n  fi\nfi\nif [ \"$NEED_INSTALL\" = \"1\" ]; then\n  sh /tmp/onchainos_verify/install.sh >/tmp/onchainos_verify/install.log 2>&1 || { cat /tmp/onchainos_verify/install.log; exit 3; }\n  echo 'INSTALL_RAN=1'\nelse\n  echo 'INSTALL_RAN=0'\nfi\nVERSION=$(onchainos --version | awk '{print $2}')\nTAG=\"v$VERSION\"\ncurl -sSL \"https://github.com/okx/onchainos-skills/releases/download/${TAG}/checksums.txt\" -o /tmp/onchainos_verify/checksums.txt\nARCH=$(uname -m)\nOS=$(uname -s)\ncase \"$OS:$ARCH\" in\n  Linux:x86_64) TARGET='x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu' ;;\n  Linux:aarch64) TARGET='aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu' ;;\n  Linux:i686) TARGET='i686-unknown-linux-gnu' ;;\n  Linux:armv7l) TARGET='armv7-unknown-linux-gnueabihf' ;;\n  Darwin:arm64) TARGET='aarch64-apple-darwin' ;;\n  Darwin:x86_64) TARGET='x86_64-apple-darwin' ;;\n  *) echo \"UNSUPPORTED_PLATFORM=$OS:$ARCH\"; exit 4 ;;\nesac\nEXPECTED_BIN=$(grep \"$TARGET\" /tmp/onchainos_verify/checksums.txt | awk '{print $1}' | head -n1)\nBIN_PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin/onchainos\"\nACTUAL_BIN=$(sha256sum \"$BIN_PATH\" | awk '{print $1}')\necho \"VERSION=$VERSION\"\necho \"TARGET=$TARGET\"\necho \"EXPECTED_BIN=$EXPECTED_BIN\"\necho \"ACTUAL_BIN=$ACTUAL_BIN\"\nif [ \"$EXPECTED_BIN\" != \"$ACTUAL_BIN\" ]; then\n  echo 'BINARY_CHECKSUM_MISMATCH'\n  exit 5\nfi","workdir":"/home/zbb/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":180}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":425,"output":889,"cacheRead":51328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52642,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777084739348,"responseId":"resp_0761e5a54e774b860169ec29474f4c8191baee9cec293eadfc"}}
