{"type":"message","id":"1e6ec6dc","parentId":"15bede8c","timestamp":"2026-04-25T14:44:59.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying token inquiry**\n\nI’m thinking the user might have meant “BSBU” when they typed “bsbu.” Should I ask for clarification about that? It could be helpful to analyze BUBS too, especially if they’re looking for token analysis. I probably should pick the most relevant skill, which might be the OKX dex token. It seems best to search for the BSBU token directly as a next step. Let’s do an on-chain token search for BSBU.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我先用 OKX 查一下 `BSBU` 是哪条链上的哪个币，再给你做分析。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rfT1HEDjM2EeRaoRb4dc3mLf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"onchainos token search --query BSBU --chains \"ethereum,solana,base,bsc,arbitrum\"","workdir":"/home/zbb/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":20000,"timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":182,"output":238,"cacheRead":76416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76836,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777128283600,"responseId":"resp_0c499460432e78600169ecd36514c48191bbdcfc5b501da477"}}
