{"type":"message","id":"091ecbc3","parentId":"e81f71a1","timestamp":"2026-04-25T15:14:33.271Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]改好了。\n\n## 已修改\n- skill 名称：`bitcon`\n- skill 目录：`/home/zbb/.openclaw/workspace/skills/bitcon`\n- 打包文件：`/home/zbb/.openclaw/workspace/dist/bitcon.skill`\n\n## 已提交 git\ncommit:\n`52c2a99 Rename altcoin review skill to bitcon`\n\n## 以后怎么调用\n你直接说：\n\n- **用 bitcon 审查 APE**\n- **用 bitcon 分析 API3**\n- **按 bitcon 流程审查这个山寨币**\n- **用 bitcon，禁止假设推断，只给证据版结论**\n\n最好再带上：\n- 链\n- 合约地址\n\n### 最短模板\n> 用 bitcon 审查 [币名]，链是 [chain]，合约是 [address]。禁止假设推断，所有结论必须有依据。\n\n如果你愿意，我也可以继续帮你把 skill 的**显示标题、说明文案、触发词**都改得更像你自己的风格。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":743,"output":248,"cacheRead":153344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":154335,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777130042177,"responseId":"resp_09193292c0179eb60169ecda5316bc8191a96e44b7403f37d7"}}
